# Shortcuts validate-on-write

When you create or edit a Shortcuts plist / `.shortcut.xml` in this repo:

1. Run `./scripts/validate_on_write.sh <file>` after every Write/Edit.
2. If grammar fails on **UUID case** or **WFControlFlowMode as string**, run:
   `./scripts/validate_on_write.sh --fix <file>` (Craig Loop lite, max 3 safe fixes).
3. Do **not** auto-fix business semantics (wrong action IDs, bad ranges, invented AppIntents).
4. Mac import/run: `./scripts/attest_local.sh --auto` (see `references/ATTEST_AUTOMATION.md`).
